ãÖßÉ"ØOn December 8, 2025, AnkiConnect stopped working on the WebApp I developed. After countless tests, updates, downgrades, and configuration changes, I verified that the problem was not with the browser, the app, Anki, or AnkiConnect, but rather with the flag permissions in Edge and Chrome. To fix the error, simply access chrome://flags (or edge://flags), search for 'Local Network Access check', and change the setting from 'Default' to 'Disabled'. Click 'Relaunch'. Done!
