After upgrading to the latest beta version, the plugin encountered an error.
Reason for the issue:After upgrading to Anki version 25.08b5, the version number now includes a beta identifier (b5)
The original version parsing mechanism of the plugin is limited to purely numeric version formats and fails to handle version numbers that include alphabetic characters.When attempting to convert the string '08b5' to an integer, Python throws a ValueError exception
